    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE FLOORS OF NEFARIUM</strong></h2><br>The dungeons of Nefarium change each time you enter, introducing variety in how you will get to the end. Difficulty rises with each completed floor as monsters start to get stronger. But beware, if you die, you will lose the current floor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE BOSS</strong></h2><br>Everything in the dungeon wants a piece of you, especially the boss awaiting you at the end of a floor. Kill your enemies, collect their souls, level up and unlock powerful abilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/c888ea6a71fb38d53b518a18d35fcde8.poster.avif?t=1716482434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/c888ea6a71fb38d53b518a18d35fcde8.webm?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/c888ea6a71fb38d53b518a18d35fcde8.mp4?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WIELD STRONG AND UNIQUE EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><br>Upgrade your items and potions with the materials you acquire from the dungeons. Don't rely on randomized stats to get stronger than before. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/a23e5ce918c3a36268aa919947498aaa.avif?t=1716482434\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><br>There isn't a class system in Nefarium, meaning anyone can wear any kind of equipment that they find. Legendary and Corrupted items don't have randomized stats, so you don't have to worry about finding a better version of your dream gear!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/1c51e009549c29d64a991b72880e44a7.poster.avif?t=1716482434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/1c51e009549c29d64a991b72880e44a7.webm?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/1c51e009549c29d64a991b72880e44a7.mp4?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roadmap</h2><br>As Nefarium is in development, it is missing some of features that will make the game more complex eventually. You can find a small list of all the things that are either in development or are planned below.<br><br><strong>Long Term Goals:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Way more items with unique properties!<br></li><li> Way more abilities!<br></li><li> Appearance changer<br></li><li> More and better sound effects<br></li><li> Music<br></li><li> An <strong>Endurance Mode</strong> where you will be able to start from the very bottom and see just how far you can go without dying.<br></li><li> Better animations overall</li></ul><br>And more!<br><br>If you'd like to keep up to date with Nefarium's progress, don't forget to join my Discord server and add it to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> to be notified when it's released!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE FLOORS OF NEFARIUM</strong></h2><br>The dungeons of Nefarium change each time you enter, introducing variety in how you will get to the end. Difficulty rises with each completed floor as monsters start to get stronger. But beware, if you die, you will lose the current floor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE BOSS</strong></h2><br>Everything in the dungeon wants a piece of you, especially the boss awaiting you at the end of a floor. Kill your enemies, collect their souls, level up and unlock powerful abilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/c888ea6a71fb38d53b518a18d35fcde8.poster.avif?t=1716482434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/c888ea6a71fb38d53b518a18d35fcde8.webm?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/c888ea6a71fb38d53b518a18d35fcde8.mp4?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WIELD STRONG AND UNIQUE EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><br>Upgrade your items and potions with the materials you acquire from the dungeons. Don't rely on randomized stats to get stronger than before. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/a23e5ce918c3a36268aa919947498aaa.avif?t=1716482434\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><br>There isn't a class system in Nefarium, meaning anyone can wear any kind of equipment that they find. Legendary and Corrupted items don't have randomized stats, so you don't have to worry about finding a better version of your dream gear!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/1c51e009549c29d64a991b72880e44a7.poster.avif?t=1716482434\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/1c51e009549c29d64a991b72880e44a7.webm?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1801050/extras/1c51e009549c29d64a991b72880e44a7.mp4?t=1716482434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roadmap</h2><br>As Nefarium is in development, it is missing some of features that will make the game more complex eventually. You can find a small list of all the things that are either in development or are planned below.<br><br><strong>Long Term Goals:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Way more items with unique properties!<br></li><li> Way more abilities!<br></li><li> Appearance changer<br></li><li> More and better sound effects<br></li><li> Music<br></li><li> An <strong>Endurance Mode</strong> where you will be able to start from the very bottom and see just how far you can go without dying.<br></li><li> Better animations overall</li></ul><br>And more!<br><br>If you'd like to keep up to date with Nefarium's progress, don't forget to join my Discord server and add it to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> to be notified when it's released!<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Nefarium is an ARPG dungeon crawler where every floor is randomly generated. Upgrade your items, unleash powerful abilities, and use the elements in your favor. See how far you can go as you take on the endless dungeon.",
